{
  "_comment": "每個角色可寫入的路徑。CI 依此擋 PR。AGENTS.md 是給 Agent 看的請求,本檔是給你看的保證。_derived 是衍生產物:沒有角色擁有它,內容的權威是 guard 指定的檢查,見 contract/decisions/ADR-002-derived-artifacts-guarded-by-regeneration.md。",
  "_everyone": ["change-requests/"],
  "_derived": {
    "generated/": {
      "note": "由 gen:types 從 contract/openapi.yaml 生成,不由任何角色撰寫。",
      "writers": ["architect", "infra"],
      "inputs": ["contract/openapi.yaml", "scripts/gen-types.sh", "package.json", "pnpm-lock.yaml"],
      "guard": "check:drift"
    }
  },
  "roles": {
    "architect": {
      "allow": ["contract/"],
      "note": "唯一能改 API contract 與 DB migration 的角色"
    },
    "infra": {
      "allow": [
        ".github/",
        ".claude/",
        "scripts/",
        "CLAUDE.md",
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml",
        "tsconfig.json",
        "backend/tsconfig.json",
        "frontend/tsconfig.json",
        "e2e/tsconfig.json",
        "Dockerfile",
        "docker-compose.yml",
        ".env.example",
        ".gitignore",
        ".gitattributes",
        "README.md",
        "AGENTS.md",
        "backend/AGENTS.md",
        "frontend/AGENTS.md",
        "infra/"
      ],
      "note": "規則的執行者。實作角色不得改動 CI,否則測試紅了可以直接把檢查拿掉。同理,AGENTS.md 由 infra 保管 —— 角色不得改寫自己被賦予的規則。"
    },
    "backend": {
      "allow": ["backend/src/"],
      "note": "不得改 contract、frontend、e2e"
    },
    "frontend": {
      "allow": ["frontend/src/"],
      "note": "不得改 contract、backend、e2e"
    },
    "qa": {
      "allow": ["e2e/"],
      "note": "只讀驗收條件與 contract,不讀實作"
    }
  }
}
